{
    "title": "AI Mail Home",
    "description": "Get more done by transforming your home screen with AI Mail Homescreen. \r\n\r\nAI Mail Launcher is a launcher app that transforms your Android home screen into an all-in-one, intuitive, AI-powered emailing engine. \r\n\r\nThanks to the powerful Launcher technology you can connect your Gmail, Outlook, and/or Yahoo inboxes and easily access all your emails right on your home screen without switching between multiple email apps. \r\n\r\nLet AI write emails for you so you can get more time in your day, improve your daily performance, and productivity.\r\n\r\nCore Features:\r\n\r\n    AI Mail Reply - No more thinking about how to write your emails. Just type in what you want to reply, hit \u201cReply with AI\u201d, and AI Mail will write an email for you.\r\n\r\n    Combine your Outlook and Yahoo Email Accounts in one inbox. No more switching between your email apps.\r\n\r\n    One-Tap Spam Blocker - Block spam in seconds. Keep your inboxes clean & secure.\r\n\r\n    Connect Unlimited Outlook and Yahoo Accounts!\r\n\r\n    Calendar Invites in your mailbox: Never miss an important event from your Yahoo or Outlook calendars.\r\n\r\n    One-Tap Account Switching: Easily switch between your mail accounts.\r\n\r\n    Voice-Enabled Mail Search: Find any mail with ease using your voice.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd16 Get Back Your Time with AI Smart Reply\r\n\r\nStop overthinking how to write your emails. Let AI write them for you, the way you want it. Just type in what you want to reply to, and AI Mail will write an email for you. You can rephrase it, or make the email longer or shorter.  Use that extra time to crush it at work, learn some cool new stuff, or just kick back and enjoy some you-time.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce8 All-in-one Inbox\r\n\r\nView all your emails, from all your accounts, in one place. Eliminate the headache of overlooked emails and frustrating app-switching.  Now, you can manage all your email accounts in one single place.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udeab One-Tap Spam Blocker\r\n\r\nBlocking spam emails has never been easier. Just tap on \u201cblock\u201d button and you will never see an email from the sender in your primary inbox.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 Calendar Invites in Your Mailbox\r\n\r\nNever miss an important event. No need to frantically check your calendar app fearing to miss an important event. Now you can see all your calendar invites straight in your email. Keep track of your appointments and special events right in your inbox.\r\n\r\n\r\nAndroid\u2122 is a trademark of Google LLC.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get more done by transforming your home screen with AI Mail Homescreen. <br><br>AI Mail Launcher is a launcher app that transforms your Android home screen into an all-in-one, intuitive, AI-powered emailing engine. <br><br>Thanks to the powerful Launcher technology you can connect your Gmail, Outlook, and/or Yahoo inboxes and easily access all your emails right on your home screen without switching between multiple email apps. <br><br>Let AI write emails for you so you can get more time in your day, improve your daily performance, and productivity.<br><br>Core Features:<br><br>    AI Mail Reply - No more thinking about how to write your emails. Just type in what you want to reply, hit \u201cReply with AI\u201d, and AI Mail will write an email for you.<br><br>    Combine your Outlook and Yahoo Email Accounts in one inbox. No more switching between your email apps.<br><br>    One-Tap Spam Blocker - Block spam in seconds. Keep your inboxes clean &amp; secure.<br><br>    Connect Unlimited Outlook and Yahoo Accounts!<br><br>    Calendar Invites in your mailbox: Never miss an important event from your Yahoo or Outlook calendars.<br><br>    One-Tap Account Switching: Easily switch between your mail accounts.<br><br>    Voice-Enabled Mail Search: Find any mail with ease using your voice.<br><br><br>\ud83e\udd16 Get Back Your Time with AI Smart Reply<br><br>Stop overthinking how to write your emails. Let AI write them for you, the way you want it. Just type in what you want to reply to, and AI Mail will write an email for you. You can rephrase it, or make the email longer or shorter.  Use that extra time to crush it at work, learn some cool new stuff, or just kick back and enjoy some you-time.<br><br>\ud83d\udce8 All-in-one Inbox<br><br>View all your emails, from all your accounts, in one place. Eliminate the headache of overlooked emails and frustrating app-switching.  Now, you can manage all your email accounts in one single place.<br><br>\ud83d\udeab One-Tap Spam Blocker<br><br>Blocking spam emails has never been easier. Just tap on \u201cblock\u201d button and you will never see an email from the sender in your primary inbox.<br><br>\ud83d\udcc5 Calendar Invites in Your Mailbox<br><br>Never miss an important event. No need to frantically check your calendar app fearing to miss an important event. Now you can see all your calendar invites straight in your email. Keep track of your appointments and special events right in your inbox.<br><br><br>Android\u2122 is a trademark of Google LLC.",
